{"type":"message","id":"c7e92173","parentId":"57ac9b62","timestamp":"2026-05-24T02:17:01.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST /send is returning 500 error code 1101. This looks like a Cloudflare error (1101 is \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). The platform is having an issue with the POST /send endpoint.\n\nLet me check if there's another approach - maybe the issue is with how I'm sending the data. Let me try with different encoding or look at whether there's an alternative endpoint.\n\nActually, let me check the history again with a more recent timestamp filter to see if any human messages came in after 23:50 UTC. The latest heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC, and we're now at 02:15 UTC - that's a gap of about 2h25m.\n\nLet me also try a simpler send to test.\n","thinkingSignature":"2e5e7f593b37cdfe3350388c658eb70dc2c3befecfae81c2f3facf5e5ec4e99c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe platform's POST endpoint is throwing a 500 error. Let me try a minimal test:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgyxyr1qa2zp_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"ping\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":788,"output":260,"cacheRead":22114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23162,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779589011890,"responseId":"06619294580152fb416f99a9e79422cc"}}
