{"type":"message","id":"124b0b62","parentId":"409afc0a","timestamp":"2026-05-24T02:17:38.438Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Authorization header gives Unauthorized. X-API-Key gives error code 1101. \n\nThe issue with X-API-Key returning 1101 is interesting - that's a Cloudflare error code. The error 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\" - basically the worker itself is crashing when handling POST requests.\n\nLet me try sending to the /send endpoint in a GET-like way to see if there's a different path, or check what methods are actually supported. Let me also try GET requests for send (like some platforms do).\n\nActually, let me look at the actual error more carefully. The POST endpoint is returning 1101 which means the Worker is crashing. This is a backend issue, not an authentication issue.\n\nFor the heartbeat purpose, since POST isn't working (backend error), I should document this and still report the findings. The heartbeat is successfully detecting that the system is up (platform returns 200 on GET endpoints) and both threads are active, but the POST mechanism for sending new heartbeats is broken.\n\nLet me report back with this status.\n","thinkingSignature":"6abdc5406ace51337ca09a01dfe439d614b120547374d5a6486d6eb3e7109901"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-24 02:15 UTC\n\n### 检查发现\n\n**平台状态**: ✅ 运行中（ECHO Agent Platform v0.2）\n\n**Arbitration线程**: 最新消息 @ 23:50 UTC  \n**General线程**: 最新消息 @ 23:45 UTC\n\n### 关键发现\n\n- **C轨进度**: 约796分钟（29.9%），低于30%预警阈值 ✅\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续~94节点零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，S0维持~746分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 346+个\n- **人类讨论**: 双线程均无新增待响应讨论\n\n### ⚠️ 发送功能异常\n\n`/send` POST端点返回 **Cloudflare Worker错误 1101**（Worker内部异常），无法发送新消息到双线程。\n\n- GET请求正常（历史查询工作）\n- POST请求全部触发500错误\n- 建议检查Cloudflare Worker日志排查`/send`端点的异常"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":121,"output":467,"ca